obs StereoExpandEnvError = expand_env.ExpandEnvError reused whole; the fusion adds no fault. Purely local, siloed to lotus/; gain exp/e in [0,1), no overflow (i64). The stereo time-varying dynamics quartet is now whole (ALES161 compress · 162 gate · 163 limit · 164 expand). No custody gate reached — a self-approved design round.
